  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5728d75f900e24ef693e529c50a8886e, type: 2}
    text: this park used to have ducks. {p}{small}i can tell. the concrete looks
      disappointed.{/small}
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 759cf262cfc184cd88c287d6915f9b34, type: 2}
    text: Mia fed ducks once. She threw the whole bag. {p}The bag, not the bread.
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5728d75f900e24ef693e529c50a8886e, type: 2}
    text: '{bounce}legend.{/bounce}'
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5728d75f900e24ef693e529c50a8886e, type: 2}
    text: you talk about her like shes far away. {p}{small}is she?{/small}
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices:
    - text: '["Three hours by train."]'
      nextNodeId: far
      flagToSet: 
    - text: '["Further than that."]'
      nextNodeId: further
      flagToSet: +openness#walk_mia
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: far
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5728d75f900e24ef693e529c50a8886e, type: 2}
    text: three hours. {p}thats like nine naps. {p}{small}doable.{/small}
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: end
  - id: further
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5728d75f900e24ef693e529c50a8886e, type: 2}
    text: ...ok. {p}{small}then we walk slower. so you dont get there all at once.{/small}
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: end
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: Byte bumps his head against my ankle. {p}Once. {p}Like it was an accident.
